CREATE TABLE "CustomerDocumentRequirement" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"customerId" TEXT NOT NULL,"type" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL,"ownerUserId" TEXT,"dueAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"sourceType" TEXT NOT NULL,"sourceId" TEXT,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "CustomerDocumentRequirement_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"));
